<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Construct improved variations of warcaskets which lean towards speed, protection or a balanced approach.-->
  <VFEP_AdvancedWarcaskets.description>解锁组装性能更强的进阶型战棺。</VFEP_AdvancedWarcaskets.description>
  <VFEP_AdvancedWarcaskets.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->warcasket evolution-->
    <li>subject-&gt;战棺迭代</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->refined warcasket designs for speed, durability, and versatility, setting new standards in mechanized warfare-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;改进了战棺的速度、耐久和多功能性，为机械化战争制定了新准则</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted war machines that danced in battlefields with lethal grace-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;制造了能在战场上跳起死亡之舞的战争机器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->balanced the trinity of speed, protection, and firepower in a symphony of destruction-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在毁灭的交响乐中平衡速度、防护与火力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->enhancing the anatomy of war-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;加强对战场局势的解析</li>
  </VFEP_AdvancedWarcaskets.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: advanced warcaskets-->
  <VFEP_AdvancedWarcaskets.label>进阶型战棺</VFEP_AdvancedWarcaskets.label>
  <!--EN: Utilise new spacer technologies to create upscaled weapons designed to be mounted on warcaskets.-->
  <VFEP_SpacerWarcasketWeaponry.description>解锁建造与战棺配套使用的太空时代科技级别武器。</VFEP_SpacerWarcasketWeaponry.description>
  <VFEP_SpacerWarcasketWeaponry.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->spacer-grade armaments-->
    <li>subject-&gt;太空时代军备</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->harnessed the mysteries of spacer tech to craft weapons of unrivaled potency for warcaskets-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;利用太空时代科技的奥秘，为战棺制造出性能极其出色的武器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ushered in an era where warcaskets wielded the power to alter the course of wars with a single shot-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;引领了一个战棺只开一枪就能改变战争方向的时代</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->married the art of war to the science of the stars, creating armaments born of the cosmos-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将战争技艺与星际科学融合，创造出源于宇宙的军备</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->wielding the stars' wrath-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;运用着群星之怒</li>
  </VFEP_SpacerWarcasketWeaponry.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: spacer warcasket weaponry-->
  <VFEP_SpacerWarcasketWeaponry.label>太空时代战棺武器</VFEP_SpacerWarcasketWeaponry.label>
  <!--EN: Manufacture Spacer-era warcaskets - a pinacle of war technology.-->
  <VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets.description>解锁组装太空时代科技级别的战棺。</VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets.description>
  <VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->pinnacle of mechanized warfare-->
    <li>subject-&gt;机械化战争的尖端成果</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->crafted warcaskets that harnessed spacer-era technology, embodying the zenith of military engineering-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;利用太空时代技术制造了新一代战棺，展现了军事工程学的顶峰</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->merged the cutting edge of space-age tech with the ancient art of war, creating unparalleled battle machines-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创造出了融合太空时代科技顶尖成果和远古战争技艺的伟大作战机器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->redefined the battlefield with warcaskets that were legends incarnate-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;通过传说的化身战棺重新定义了战场</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->achieving the apex of combat evolution-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;努力达到战斗进化的顶点</li>
  </VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: spacer warcaskets-->
  <VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets.label>太空时代战棺</VFEP_SpacerWarcaskets.label>
  <!--EN: Manufacture warcaskets designed to fit specialized roles.-->
  <VFEP_SpecialisedWarcaskets.description>解锁组装特点鲜明的特化型战棺。</VFEP_SpecialisedWarcaskets.description>
  <VFEP_SpecialisedWarcaskets.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->custom combat solutions-->
    <li>subject-&gt;定制战斗方案</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->designed warcaskets with specialized roles, from silent assassins to unstoppable juggernauts-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;设计了静谧刺客、无畏勇士等定位特化的战棺</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->broke the mold of traditional warfare, introducing units tailored for specific tactical needs-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;打破了传统的作战方式，引入为特殊战术需求而量身定制的单位</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->elevated the warcasket program to new heights with bespoke war machines-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;用定制化的战争机器将战棺项目推向新高度</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->specializing the gears of war-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;醉心研究战争装备</li>
  </VFEP_SpecialisedWarcaskets.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: specialised warcaskets-->
  <VFEP_SpecialisedWarcaskets.label>特化型战棺</VFEP_SpecialisedWarcaskets.label>
  <!--EN: Craft suits which combine alcohol distillation and nutrient paste synthesis to produce rum from recycled human waste.-->
  <VFEP_SweatFermentation.description>将酒精提纯与营养膏合成科技相结合，解锁制作能利用人类体液生产朗姆酒的「朗姆酒套装」。</VFEP_SweatFermentation.description>
  <VFEP_SweatFermentation.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->biochemical ingenuity-->
    <li>subject-&gt;生化独创力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->turned the cycle of waste into a source of sustenance and spirit, crafting rum from the sweat of toil-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将人体的排泄物循环利用以转化为营养与烈酒，用辛劳的汗水酿造朗姆酒</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->blurred the lines between distillation and desperation, finding innovation in the unconventional-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;模糊了蒸馏与绝望间的界限，通过非常规方法寻求创新</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->created a self-sustaining cycle of work, waste, and whiskey, fueling both body and morale-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;创造了一种工作→排泄物→朗姆酒的自循环体系，以此促动身体与精神</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->brewing resilience from refuse-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;用排泄物酿造美酒</li>
  </VFEP_SweatFermentation.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: sweat fermentation-->
  <VFEP_SweatFermentation.label>汗液发酵</VFEP_SweatFermentation.label>
  <!--EN: Unlocks the operation “remove warcasket” to remove a pawn from a warcasket, losing both their arms and legs, and reducing the warcasket to slag.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketRemoval.description>解锁能够卸除战棺的特殊手术。接受手术的殖民者会失去四肢，而战棺的机体也将变成可回收的钢渣块。</VFEP_WarcasketRemoval.description>
  <VFEP_WarcasketRemoval.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the cost of war-->
    <li>subject-&gt;战争的代价</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->developed techniques to reclaim warriors from their metal confines, a bittersweet victory over the machine-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;研发了将战士们从“金属棺材”中解放出来的技术，这是对抗机器的惨痛胜利</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->faced the grim reality of extracting the human core from the war machine, sacrificing limb for life-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;面对必须牺牲肢体才能将人从战争机器中解放出来的残酷事实</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->turned the promise of mechanized might into the pain of loss, with every warcasket removal a reminder of war's toll-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将机械化之力的承诺转变为失去的痛苦，每次卸除战棺都会警示人们战争所带来的伤亡</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->unraveling the bond between flesh and steel-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;解除血肉与钢铁间的联系</li>
  </VFEP_WarcasketRemoval.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: warcasket removal-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketRemoval.label>战棺卸除</VFEP_WarcasketRemoval.label>
  <!--EN: Build upscaled weapons designed to be mounted on warcaskets.-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketWeaponry.description>解锁建造与战棺配套使用的高级武器。</VFEP_WarcasketWeaponry.description>
  <VFEP_WarcasketWeaponry.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->armament innovation-->
    <li>subject-&gt;军备革新</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered devastating weaponry for warcaskets, turning them into walking arsenals-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为战棺制造了威力惊人的武器，将其变为移动军械库</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->bridged the gap between artillery power and infantry flexibility-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;弥补了火炮威力与步兵灵活性之间的差距</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->granted warcaskets the firepower to decimate, defend, and dominate-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;让战棺获得用于杀戮、防御以及支配的火力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->arming the giants of war-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;武装战争巨人</li>
  </VFEP_WarcasketWeaponry.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: warcasket weaponry-->
  <VFEP_WarcasketWeaponry.label>战棺武器</VFEP_WarcasketWeaponry.label>
  <!--EN: Build warcasket foundries to manufacture basic warcasket parts and outfit pawns to utilise said warcaskets.-->
  <VFEP_Warcaskets.description>解锁建造「战棺铸造厂」，你可以用它来组装最基础的战棺。</VFEP_Warcaskets.description>
  <VFEP_Warcaskets.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->mechanized infantry development-->
    <li>subject-&gt;机械化步兵的研发</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->initiated the age of warcaskets, transforming foot soldiers into titans on the battlefield-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将步兵变为战场上的主宰，开创了战棺的时代</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->mastered the art of warcasket manufacturing, melding metal and might into a singular force-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;掌握了铸造战棺的技艺，将金属与血肉合为一种奇特的力量</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ushered in a new era of warfare, where the line between man and machine blurred-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;模糊人与机器间的界限，引领了战争的新时代</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->pioneering the future of combat-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;开创未来战斗的新形式</li>
  </VFEP_Warcaskets.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: warcaskets-->
  <VFEP_Warcaskets.label>基础型战棺</VFEP_Warcaskets.label>
</LanguageData>
